Description: Defer optional secondary IMSI until the data bearer connects
 Retain synchronous slot presence, the factory dual-stack power plan and
 command ownership. Hydrate inactive SIM metadata through MM after connection,
 checking current SIM object and ICCID before publishing a delayed response.
Author: e5-linux
Forwarded: no

--- a/src/plugins/unisoc/mm-broadband-modem-unisoc.c
